; Per-pass stored-data downlink (DH-L2-13 / CDH-27): close and send the newest
; DataRecorder segment of each stream. Events first (smaller, higher value).
; Decode the received files with tools/recorder_reader.py.
R00:00:00 ReferenceDeployment.dataRecorder.DOWNLINK_NEWEST, EVT
R00:00:02 ReferenceDeployment.dataRecorder.DOWNLINK_NEWEST, TLM
